{"id":"7d6a6dd48825bc92","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-finite-consistency-uniformity-gap.md","title":"逐个有限实例不等于统一一致性证明","display":"thm-finite-consistency-uniformity-gap — 逐个有限实例不等于统一一致性证明","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-finite-consistency-uniformity-gap","aliases":["72-thm-finite-consistency-uniformity-gap"],"display":"thm-finite-consistency-uniformity-gap — 逐个有限实例不等于统一一致性证明","depends_on":["[[72-df-finite-code-consistency]]","[[72-lem-second-incompleteness]]"],"chapter":"VIII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VIII §6 and Ch.II §2.2, print577–579,118–122/PDF589–591,130–134; local HBL consequence","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-finite-consistency-uniformity-gap"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-finite-consistency-uniformity-gap</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-finite-consistency-uniformity-gap — 逐个有限实例不等于统一一致性证明"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"245122d1b4e24cdf\" href=\"?note=245122d1b4e24cdf\" title=\"72-df-finite-code-consistency\">72-df-finite-code-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0869da29c285cc44\" href=\"?note=0869da29c285cc44\" title=\"72-lem-second-incompleteness\">72-lem-second-incompleteness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VIII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VIII §6 and Ch.II §2.2, print577–579,118–122/PDF589–591,130–134; local HBL consequence"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>T、κ 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"245122d1b4e24cdf\" href=\"?note=245122d1b4e24cdf\" title=\"72-df-finite-code-consistency\">72-df-finite-code-consistency</a>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PRA}\\subseteq T\">\\(\\mathsf{PRA}\\subseteq T\\)</span>。HBL、FP、Con 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0869da29c285cc44\" href=\"?note=0869da29c285cc44\" title=\"72-lem-second-incompleteness\">72-lem-second-incompleteness</a> 及其上游；使用同一数语法演算。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PRA}\\vdash_2^{(1)}\n\\left[\\forall x_2\\operatorname{FinCon}_{T,\\kappa}(x_2)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{PRA}\\vdash_2^{(1)}\n\\left[\\forall x_2\\operatorname{FinCon}_{T,\\kappa}(x_2)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HBL}(T,\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{FP}(T,\\kappa)\\land\n\\operatorname{Con}^{(1)}_{\\rm meta}(T)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\nT\\nvdash_2^{(1)}\\forall x_2\\operatorname{FinCon}_{T,\\kappa}(x_2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HBL}(T,\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{FP}(T,\\kappa)\\land\n\\operatorname{Con}^{(1)}_{\\rm meta}(T)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\nT\\nvdash_2^{(1)}\\forall x_2\\operatorname{FinCon}_{T,\\kappa}(x_2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Con 推出所有截断句是逻辑弱化；反向对任意 p 取界 Sp，使用 p&lt;Sp 得到无界的否证条件，故 PRA 内等价。若 T 证明统一句，就证明同一 κ 的 Con，违反显式 HBL 与不动点条件下的第二不完备性。与逐个标准实例的证明并不矛盾。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-finite-code-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"245122d1b4e24cdf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-finite-code-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-second-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"0869da29c285cc44","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-second-incompleteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-finite-code-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"245122d1b4e24cdf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"T、κ 取 [[72-df-finite-code-consistency]]，且 $\\mathsf{PRA}\\subseteq T$。HBL、FP、Con 取 [[72-lem-second-incompleteness]] 及其上游；使用同一数语法演算。","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-second-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"0869da29c285cc44","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"T、κ 取 [[72-df-finite-code-consistency]]，且 $\\mathsf{PRA}\\subseteq T$。HBL、FP、Con 取 [[72-lem-second-incompleteness]] 及其上游；使用同一数语法演算。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{PRA}\\subseteq T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PRA}\\vdash_2^{(1)}\n\\left[\\forall x_2\\operatorname{FinCon}_{T,\\kappa}(x_2)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T)\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HBL}(T,\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{FP}(T,\\kappa)\\land\n\\operatorname{Con}^{(1)}_{\\rm meta}(T)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\nT\\nvdash_2^{(1)}\\forall x_2\\operatorname{FinCon}_{T,\\kappa}(x_2).","display":true}],"bytes":1794,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-168","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-binary-arithmetic-numeral]] · [[72-df-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-df-polynomial-numeration]] · [[72-df-proof-system-binary-join]] · [[72-thm-each-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-thm-finite-consistency-uniformity-gap]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-bound-implies-optimal]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-simulates]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-542","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-binary-arithmetic-numeral]] · [[72-df-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-df-polynomial-numeration]] · [[72-df-proof-system-binary-join]] · [[72-thm-each-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-thm-finite-consistency-uniformity-gap]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-bound-implies-optimal]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-simulates]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-537","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-binary-arithmetic-numeral]] · [[72-df-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-df-polynomial-numeration]] · [[72-df-proof-system-binary-join]] · [[72-thm-each-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-thm-finite-consistency-uniformity-gap]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-bound-implies-optimal]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-simulates]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-165","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-binary-arithmetic-numeral]] · [[72-df-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-df-polynomial-numeration]] · [[72-df-proof-system-binary-join]] · [[72-thm-each-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-thm-finite-consistency-uniformity-gap]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-bound-implies-optimal]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-simulates]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-537","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII